name: ['Ambassador Oak', 'Beacon of Destruction', 'Beacon of Tomorrows', 'Beast Attack', 'Boldwyr Intimidator', 'Burning-Tree Emissary', 'Call of the Herd', 'Cloudcrown Oak', 'Coat of Arms', 'Deep-Sea Kraken', 'Desperate Ritual', 'Empty the Warrens', 'Firebolt', "Firemind's Foresight", 'Forest', 'Goblin Electromancer', 'Gorehorn Minotaurs', 'Grapeshot', 'Guttural Response', 'Harmonize', 'Increasing Savagery', 'Island', 'Jhoira of the Ghitu', 'Jori En, Ruin Diver', 'Kamahl, Pit Fighter', 'Kruin Striker', 'Lovisa Coldeyes', "Mind's Desire", 'Mountain', 'Nivix Cyclops', 'Nucklavee', 'Peer Through Depths', 'Quicken', 'Radha, Heir to Keld', 'Rampant Growth', 'Reach Through Mists', 'Relentless Hunter', 'Rift Bolt', 'Roar of the Wurm', 'Rubblebelt Raiders', 'Rugged Highlands', 'Sage-Eye Avengers', 'Shivan Meteor', 'Sift Through Sands', 'Skarrgan Pit-Skulk', 'Snap', 'Spellheart Chimera', 'Swiftwater Cliffs', 'Sylvan Might', "Talara's Battalion", 'Talrand, Sky Summoner', 'Temporal Fissure', 'The Unspeakable', 'Volcanic Vision', 'Young Pyromancer', 'Zo-Zu the Punisher']
