rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The land does not count toward your one per turn limit because it was put onto the battlefield by an effect.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'If a creature has more than one creature type, and one of those types matches the creature you are calculating for, then count that creature. Only one type needs to match in order to get counted.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'If you have a creature with more than one creature type, count all creatures which have either creature type.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Sharing multiple creature types doesn\'t give an additional bonus. Coat of Arms counts creatures, not creature types."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'If the card is not played by end of turn, it remains exiled until end of game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The card is face-up when exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "A copy of a spell can be countered like any other spell, but it must be countered individually. Countering a spell with storm won\'t affect the copies."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "Spells cast from zones other than a player\'s hand and spells that were countered are counted by the storm ability."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "The copies are put directly onto the stack. They aren\'t cast and won\'t be counted by other spells with storm cast later in the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability that creates the copies can itself be countered by anything that can counter a triggered ability. If it is countered, no copies will be put onto the stack.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The Legend rule only applies to two legendary permanents with identical names. If the names are different, even if they depict the same character, the rule does not apply.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'If you don’t reveal an instant or sorcery card, put all the revealed cards on the bottom of your library in any order.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': "If you cast multiple Quickens on the same turn, they\'ll all apply to the very next sorcery spell you cast."}, {\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': "You don\'t choose a sorcery card when Quicken resolves. Rather, this sets up a rule that is true for you until the turn ends or until you cast a sorcery card, even if you cast that sorcery at a time you normally could."}, {\'date\': \'2006-09-25\', \'text\': \'After Quicken resolves, you can Suspend a sorcery in your hand any time you can cast an instant. As soon as you actually cast a sorcery, you lose this capability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': "Skarrgan Pit-Skulk compares each blocker\'s power against its own as blockers are being declared."}]', "[{'date': '2006-07-15', 'text': 'Each creature with at least one of those subtypes gets +2/+2 from Lovisa Coldeyes’ ability, regardless of how many of those subtypes it has. For example, a 3/3 Mistform Ultimus would become 5/5, not 9/9.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-05-01', 'text': 'Coward is a new creature type.'}, {'date': '2007-05-01', 'text': 'Each of the activated abilities replaces all creature types the affected creature may have had.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'Note that the exact wording of this card has changed since it was printed in the _Future Sight_(TM) set, but its functionality is the same.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-07-15', 'text': 'If a Beacon is countered or doesn’t resolve, it’s put into its owner’s graveyard, not shuffled into the library.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If a card in your library has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0. For example, a card with mana cost {X}{R} has a converted mana cost of 1, and so on.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'You don’t have to find any instant cards in your library, even if they are there.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'Count the number of attacking creatures you control when Rubblebelt Raiders’s ability resolves, including Rubblebelt Raiders itself, to determine how many +1/+1 counters to put on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Nivix Cyclops still has defender after its triggered ability resolves, although it will be able to attack.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'A card with a splice ability can’t be spliced onto itself because the spell is on the stack (and not in your hand) when you reveal the cards you want to splice onto it.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Desperate Ritual isn’t a mana ability. When cast, it (or the spell it’s spliced onto) goes on the stack like any spell and can be responded to.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If all of the spell’s targets are illegal when the spell tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'You choose all targets for the spell after revealing cards you want to splice, including any targets required by the text of any of those cards. You may choose a different target for each instance of the word “target” on the resulting spell.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'You reveal all cards you intend to splice at the same time. Each individual card can be spliced only once onto any one spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'A copy of a spell can be countered like any other spell, but it must be countered individually. Countering a spell with storm won’t affect the copies.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Spells cast from zones other than a player’s hand and spells that were countered are counted by the storm ability.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'The copies are put directly onto the stack. They aren’t cast and won’t be counted by other spells with storm cast later in the turn.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'The triggered ability that creates the copies can itself be countered by anything that can counter a triggered ability. If it is countered, no copies will be put onto the stack.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'You may choose new targets for any of the copies. You can choose differently for each copy.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'A creature cast using suspend will enter the battlefield with haste. It will have haste until another player gains control of it (or, in some rare cases, gains control of the creature spell itself).'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. Timing restrictions based on the card’s type are ignored.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again during the card’s owner’s next upkeep.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) is countered, the card can’t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if able. However, if an additional cost includes a mana payment, you are forced to pay that cost only if there’s enough mana in your mana pool at the time you cast the spell. You aren’t forced to activate any mana abilities, although you may do so if you wish.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it’s exiled.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If you can’t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend will trigger. It doesn’t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Spellheart Chimera\'s power functions in all zones, not just the battlefield."}]', "[{'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Any spell you cast that doesn’t have the type creature will cause prowess to trigger. If a spell has multiple types, and one of those types is creature (such as an artifact creature), casting it won’t cause prowess to trigger. Playing a land also won’t cause prowess to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Once it triggers, prowess isn’t connected to the spell that caused it to trigger. If that spell is countered, prowess will still resolve.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Prowess goes on the stack on top of the spell that caused it to trigger. It will resolve before that spell.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Prowess triggers only once for any spell, even if that spell has multiple types.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'If the target has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'If the target instant or sorcery card becomes an illegal target before Volcanic Vision resolves, the spell won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No damage will be dealt and Volcanic Vision won’t be exiled.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'Jori En must be on the battlefield in order for the ability to function. Notably, the ability won’t trigger if Jori En is the second spell you cast in a turn.'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'Jori En’s ability can trigger only once each turn. The ability will resolve before the second spell resolves. It doesn’t matter if the first spell you cast that turn has resolved, was countered, or is still on the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Burning-Tree Emissary’s ability isn’t a mana ability. It uses the stack and can be responded to.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': \'Two Goblin Electromancers will make instant and sorcery spells you cast cost {2} less to cast, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Goblin Electromancer\'s effect reduces only generic mana in the spell\'s total cost."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it’s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card’s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': '“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger, but after targets have been chosen for that spell. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'A creature cast using suspend will enter the battlefield with haste. It will have haste until another player gains control of it. (In some rare cases, another player may gain control of the creature spell itself. If this happens, the creature won’t enter the battlefield with haste.)'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don’t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Exiling a card with suspend isn’t casting that card. This action doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a “suspended card,” that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card’s owner’s next upkeep.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can’t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it’s exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you can’t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” such as with suspend, you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it’s on the stack).'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn’t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage’s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don’t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Exiling a card with suspend isn’t casting that card. This action doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a “suspended card,” that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card’s owner’s next upkeep.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can’t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it’s exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you can’t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” such as with suspend, you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it’s on the stack).'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn’t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage’s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "You choose which lands to untap as the spell resolves. They aren\'t targeted, and they don\'t have to be lands that you control."}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Radha’s triggered ability is not a mana ability because it doesn’t trigger from another mana ability. It goes on the stack and it can be responded to.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'You lose the mana produced by Radha’s ability before blockers are declared if you don’t spend it first.'}]"]
foreign_names: ["[{'name': 'ぶどう弾', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。ぶどう弾はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\\nストーム（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、このターンにこれより前に唱えられた呪文１つにつきこれを１回コピーする。あなたはそれらのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '魔道士はしばしば、時や最終戦争で失われた強力な遺物を模倣する方法を求める。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426653&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c927d296-6928-41b9-88e5-f800990521e3', 'multiverseId': 426653}, 'multiverseid': 426653}]", "[{'name': 'ギトゥのジョイラ', 'text': '{2}, あなたの手札から土地でないカード１枚を追放する：その追放したカードの上に時間カウンターを４個置く。それが待機を持っていないなら、それは待機を得る。（あなたのアップキープの開始時に、そのカードの上から時間カウンターを１個取り除く。最後の１個を取り除いたとき、それをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱える。それがクリーチャーであるなら、それは速攻を持つ。）', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426638&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2749fa1d-4834-4fe0-a670-9bb35f7aa372', 'multiverseId': 426638}, 'multiverseid': 426638}]", "[{'name': 'クルーインの打撃者', 'text': '他のクリーチャーが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、クルーインの打撃者は＋１/＋０の修整を受けるとともにトランプルを得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士', 'flavor': 'ウルフィーの誕生を快く思わなかったロリカは、命令に反し、「改心した狼男」を討伐すべく進撃を始めた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426677&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3becf831-2706-4e8a-8aee-7af5e96420bf', 'multiverseId': 426677}, 'multiverseid': 426677}]", "[{'name': 'ケルドの後継者、ラーダ', 'text': 'ケルドの後継者、ラーダが攻撃するたび、あなたはあなたのマナ・プールに{R}{R}を加えてもよい。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}を加える。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・戦士', 'flavor': '「家へ帰りな、ワンちゃん。おまえのご主人の頭は私が叩き落したのよ。そんなもので殴られたくはないでしょ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426690&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c18b5348-9e94-4713-96b3-97fbb3898640', 'multiverseId': 426690}, 'multiverseid': 426690}]", "[{'name': 'ゴブリンの電術師', 'text': 'あなたがインスタントかソーサリーである呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・ウィザード', 'flavor': 'どれだけのパワーが必要かと訊かれれば、必ず「もっとだ」と答えるのがイゼットの魔道士である。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426659&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a783819d-dc51-43f2-89f4-0b783849cdb2', 'multiverseId': 426659}, 'multiverseid': 426659}]", "[{'name': 'シヴ山の隕石', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。シヴ山の隕石はそれに13点のダメージを与える。\\n待機２―{1}{R}{R}（あなたの手札からこのカードを唱えるのではなく、あなたは{1}{R}{R}を支払うとともに時間カウンターを２個置いた状態でこれを追放してもよい。あなたのアップキープの開始時に、時間カウンターを１個取り除く。最後の１個を取り除いたとき、これをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱える。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426655&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e1f830a-3f91-438a-95be-9548a32d8a65', 'multiverseId': 426655}, 'multiverseid': 426655}]", "[{'name': 'スカルガンの穴潜み', 'text': '狂喜１（このターンに対戦相手にダメージが与えられていたなら、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。）\\nスカルガンの穴潜みよりもパワーが小さいクリーチャーでは、これをブロックできない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426687&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9108825c-4a49-49e0-8485-39b2bacb52c0', 'multiverseId': 426687}, 'multiverseid': 426687}]", "[{'name': 'タララの大隊', 'text': 'トランプル\\nタララの大隊は、あなたがこのターンに他の緑の呪文を唱えていたときにのみ唱えられる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルフ・戦士', 'flavor': '守美者のタララは優美な森林の滝を守っている。彼女はこの美を妨げるものを倒すためなら、戦士の波状攻撃をかける誓いを立てている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426689&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ac91585d-6df1-4c6a-a3ee-65ebdd3a308b', 'multiverseId': 426689}, 'multiverseid': 426689}]", "[{'name': 'ナックラヴィー', 'text': 'ナックラヴィーが戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地から赤のソーサリー・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。\\nナックラヴィーが戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地から青のインスタント・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ビースト', 'flavor': 'それが好んで味わうものは二つだけ、呪文と肉体だけだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426663&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eba684bf-ff33-448b-a0b7-a0adf576f979', 'multiverseId': 426663}, 'multiverseid': 426663}]", "[{'name': 'ニヴィックスのサイクロプス', 'text': '防衛\\nあなたがインスタントかソーサリーである呪文を１つ唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、ニヴィックスのサイクロプスは＋３/＋０の修整を受けるとともに、このターン、これは防衛を持たないかのように攻撃できる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — サイクロプス', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426661&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2572c209-64fa-44a0-958f-4703ff693b4a', 'multiverseId': 426661}, 'multiverseid': 426661}]", "[{'name': 'ピット・ファイター、カマール', 'text': '速攻\\n{T}：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。ピット・ファイター、カマールはそれに３点のダメージを与える。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・バーバリアン', 'flavor': '自由の失われた時に、それを取り戻さんと偉大なる魂が立ち上がる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426676&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '588ac2e6-6ccb-4314-804f-0981d5364ffa', 'multiverseId': 426676}, 'multiverseid': 426676}]", "[{'name': 'ボールドウィアの威嚇者', 'text': '臆病者では戦士をブロックできない。\\n{R}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは臆病者になる。\\n{2}{R}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは戦士になる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 巨人・戦士', 'flavor': '「さあ、これでお前が誰だかみんなわかったろう。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426673&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d130665-5429-4c92-a9ce-a8917cb5949c', 'multiverseId': 426673}, 'multiverseid': 426673}]", "[{'name': 'ワームの咆哮', 'text': '緑の６/６のワーム・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\nフラッシュバック{3}{G}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426686&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '14ba4480-005a-415d-a8e1-847e0c61c131', 'multiverseId': 426686}, 'multiverseid': 426686}]", "[{'name': '不屈の自然', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、そのカードをタップ状態で戦場に出す。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '自然は問題の解決法を自ら育て上げる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426685&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f09d9582-0f06-4360-bff1-297a4dff694e', 'multiverseId': 426685}, 'multiverseid': 426685}]", "[{'name': '冷眼のロヴィサ', 'text': 'バーバリアンか戦士か狂戦士である各クリーチャーは、それぞれ＋２/＋２の修整を受けるとともに速攻を持つ。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間', 'flavor': '「虐殺だと？情けをかけてやったまで。これでもう凍え死ぬ恐れはない。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426671&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f79d0c3e-f2a4-4ae0-83f5-01ed4f1b7df8', 'multiverseId': 426671}, 'multiverseid': 426671}]", "[{'name': '執拗な狩人', 'text': '{1}{R}{G}：ターン終了時まで、執拗な狩人は＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともにトランプルを得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士', 'flavor': '「殺された家族の分だけ首を持ち帰ってやるわ。まだまだ足りない。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426691&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c04d58ca-2baa-42a6-b497-d69c1a09d8bd', 'multiverseId': 426691}, 'multiverseid': 426691}]", "[{'name': '大使の樫', 'text': '大使の樫が戦場に出たとき、緑の１/１のエルフ・戦士・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ツリーフォーク・戦士', 'flavor': '樹人とエルフは森に対して共通の興味を持っているが、エルフにとっては上から見ていたほうが実際は落ち着く。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426679&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f583e55b-dddf-4f43-b0f3-ca323343789d', 'multiverseId': 426679}, 'multiverseid': 426679}]", "[{'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426668&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b34e40d6-adb4-460e-9144-e3ccd5778fc9', 'multiverseId': 426668}, 'multiverseid': 426668}]", "[{'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426669&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '06c8bef9-0158-4319-92d1-93e8a3fc7929', 'multiverseId': 426669}, 'multiverseid': 426669}]", "[{'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426670&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd7d34202-bbb1-45b9-9efc-dc2fdb0b8099', 'multiverseId': 426670}, 'multiverseid': 426670}]", "[{'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426697&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43841303-4d61-4a88-ac23-5d64a8b880cb', 'multiverseId': 426697}, 'multiverseid': 426697}]", "[{'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426698&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'af50437d-4fc8-46d9-91b0-1e522d967709', 'multiverseId': 426698}, 'multiverseid': 426698}]", "[{'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426699&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '71acb81d-62fd-4102-923c-05e6f7c53f3c', 'multiverseId': 426699}, 'multiverseid': 426699}]", "[{'name': '岩だらけの高地', 'text': '岩だらけの高地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n岩だらけの高地が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{R}か{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426696&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '460d353f-563b-472e-a553-0fa381402106', 'multiverseId': 426696}, 'multiverseid': 426696}]", "[{'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426665&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '41cc1f20-9dda-44ac-a0ba-d8a21f610eea', 'multiverseId': 426665}, 'multiverseid': 426665}]", "[{'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426666&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f67d5395-1f89-46d3-b422-1a2cd0f03ec0', 'multiverseId': 426666}, 'multiverseid': 426666}]", "[{'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426667&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0163e74-e4f1-4a39-a15c-4a408f37fdb4', 'multiverseId': 426667}, 'multiverseid': 426667}]", "[{'name': '巣穴からの総出', 'text': '赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。\\nストーム（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、このターンにこれより前に唱えられた呪文１つにつきこれを１回コピーする。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'ゴブリンが１体だけなんてあり得ない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426652&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9005bf93-d8fd-408d-b62f-337d7c6614d7', 'multiverseId': 426652}, 'multiverseid': 426652}]", "[{'name': '急かし', 'text': 'このターン、あなたは次に唱えるソーサリー・カードを、それが瞬速を持っているかのように唱えてもよい。（あなたはそれを、あなたがインスタントを唱えられるときならいつでも唱えてよい。）\\nカードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '熟練のイゼットの時術師は、砂時計の砂が一粒落ちる間に、大々的な復讐を実行することができる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426643&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c37f8300-c2b1-4a10-9de5-32547801ccf1', 'multiverseId': 426643}, 'multiverseid': 426643}]", "[{'name': '急流の崖', 'text': '急流の崖はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n急流の崖が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{U}か{R}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426664&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e2a73b92-6c0e-4d7f-9c7b-80d08d734f7c', 'multiverseId': 426664}, 'multiverseid': 426664}]", "[{'name': '捨て身の儀式', 'text': 'あなたのマナ・プールに{R}{R}{R}を加える。\\n連繋（秘儀）{1}{R}（あなたが秘儀・呪文を唱えるに際し、あなたはあなたの手札からこのカードを公開して、連繋コストを支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、このカードの効果をその呪文に加える。）', 'type': 'インスタント — 秘儀', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426651&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b4eb6c5-dd09-496b-b9ec-1d198a3978cb', 'multiverseId': 426651}, 'multiverseid': 426651}]", "[{'name': '断絶', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。土地最大２つをアンタップする。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '精神と肉体のどちらが先に断ち切られようと、いずれどちらもなくなるのだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426647&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e8136595-bd37-4fd0-8175-4b07332247dd', 'multiverseId': 426647}, 'multiverseid': 426647}]", "[{'name': '旗印', 'text': '各クリーチャーはそれぞれ、それと共通のクリーチャー・タイプを少なくとも１つ持つ戦場にある他のクリーチャー１体につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。（例えば、ゴブリン・戦士が２体とゴブリン・シャーマンが１体戦場にあるなら、それらはそれぞれ＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。）', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': '同胞の反攻を発動する旗。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426695&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '607ab411-3bce-4f29-8fdd-67a22802277a', 'multiverseId': 426695}, 'multiverseid': 426695}]", "[{'name': '明日の標', 'text': 'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、このターンの後に追加の１ターンを得る。明日の標をオーナーのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '光の中を見ることは、すなわち歴史とまみえることだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426639&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '418e908c-be3d-48d8-9fe9-9c9058c7fb18', 'multiverseId': 426639}, 'multiverseid': 426639}]", "[{'name': '時間の亀裂', 'text': 'パーマネント１つを対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\nストーム（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、このターンにこれより前に唱えられた呪文１つにつきこれを１回コピーする。あなたはそれらのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426649&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55a7b0dc-bfae-4f3a-886b-64f6c2d6cc3a', 'multiverseId': 426649}, 'multiverseid': 426649}]", "[{'name': '森', 'type': '基本土地 — 森', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426700&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d784dc3-992f-467b-b7e8-cc7c1d07d0e1', 'multiverseId': 426700}, 'multiverseid': 426700}]", "[{'name': '森', 'type': '基本土地 — 森', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426701&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2943745-e9aa-4685-b9ed-791f96227fab', 'multiverseId': 426701}, 'multiverseid': 426701}]", "[{'name': '森', 'type': '基本土地 — 森', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426702&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1accc2a3-2e36-4a06-a004-a244bd1db290', 'multiverseId': 426702}, 'multiverseid': 426702}]", "[{'name': '森の力', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋２の修整を受けるとともにトランプルを得る。\\nフラッシュバック{2}{G}{G}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426688&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '425eddfb-641c-487b-9be1-2b2d2ee6fdec', 'multiverseId': 426688}, 'multiverseid': 426688}]", "[{'name': '深海のクラーケン', 'text': '深海のクラーケンはブロックされない。\\n待機９―{2}{U}（あなたの手札からこのカードを唱えるのではなく、あなたは{2}{U}を支払うとともに時間カウンターを９個置いた状態でこれを追放してもよい。あなたのアップキープの開始時に、時間カウンターを１個取り除く。最後の１個を取り除いたとき、あなたはこれをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱える。これは速攻を持つ。）\\n対戦相手が呪文を１つ唱えるたび、深海のクラーケンが待機状態である場合、これの上から時間カウンターを１個取り除く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — クラーケン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426640&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9208e443-c939-42c2-a829-088d48555dda', 'multiverseId': 426640}, 'multiverseid': 426640}]", "[{'name': '深遠の覗き見', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを５枚見る。あなたはその中からインスタントかソーサリーであるカード１枚を公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。', 'type': 'インスタント — 秘儀', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426642&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cafc2389-ec9b-448e-a9a8-55908b6b4267', 'multiverseId': 426642}, 'multiverseid': 426642}]", "[{'name': '火山の幻視', 'text': 'あなたの墓地からインスタントかソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。火山の幻視は対戦相手がコントロールする各クリーチャーにそれぞれ、そのカードの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい点数のダメージを与える。火山の幻視を追放する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426656&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd01eedae-b6ee-4bd7-8307-356f34427532', 'multiverseId': 426656}, 'multiverseid': 426656}]", "[{'name': '火想者の予見', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーから、点数で見たマナ・コストが３のインスタント・カード１枚を探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加える。その後、点数で見たマナ・コストが２のインスタント・カードと点数で見たマナ・コストが１のインスタント・カードについても、この手順を繰り返す。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426658&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd7895c56-0206-410c-9579-50a92e25f335', 'multiverseId': 426658}, 'multiverseid': 426658}]", "[{'name': '炎の稲妻', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。炎の稲妻はそれに２点のダメージを与える。\\nフラッシュバック{4}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「同じ場所にもっとあるぞ！」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426674&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8b4ca9db-8b1c-44f0-81ca-a42e128f9d62', 'multiverseId': 426674}, 'multiverseid': 426674}]", "[{'name': '炎樹族の使者', 'text': '炎樹族の使者が戦場に出たとき、あなたのマナ・プールに{R}{G}を加える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン', 'flavor': 'グルール一族を野蛮な愚者と考える者は、彼らのシャーマンが持つ精妙な力を過小評価している。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426692&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0caa7eb4-577c-490e-bd04-7443eeedb290', 'multiverseId': 426692}, 'multiverseid': 426692}]", "[{'name': '獣の襲撃', 'text': '緑の４/４のビースト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\nフラッシュバック{2}{G}{G}{G}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426680&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9fa35a72-5a32-4eef-a519-6d02dc301ab3', 'multiverseId': 426680}, 'multiverseid': 426680}]", "[{'name': '獣群の呼び声', 'text': '緑の３/３の象・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\nフラッシュバック{3}{G}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426681&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3148f9e5-19dd-434b-8669-24fd7b4bf202', 'multiverseId': 426681}, 'multiverseid': 426681}]", "[{'name': '瓦礫帯の略奪者', 'text': '瓦礫帯の略奪者が攻撃するたび、これの上に、あなたがコントロールする攻撃クリーチャー１体につき＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士', 'flavor': '「この都は滅びるよ。グルール一族は猪神が最後の煉瓦を粉々にするのを見て歓喜するだろうね。」\\n――旧き道のニーキャ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426694&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e01bff57-d8d8-440f-ac08-4a66d964be58', 'multiverseId': 426694}, 'multiverseid': 426694}]", "[{'name': '砂のふるい分け', 'text': 'カードを２枚引き、その後カード１枚を捨てる。\\nあなたがこのターンに「深遠の覗き見」という名前の呪文と「霧中の到達」という名前の呪文を唱えていたなら、あなたはあなたのライブラリーから「語られざるもの、忌話図」という名前のカード１枚を探し、それを戦場に出してもよい。そうしたなら、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'インスタント — 秘儀', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426646&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '90d8b0c1-ed6a-41f5-ad3c-674dfe7ff3e8', 'multiverseId': 426646}, 'multiverseid': 426646}]", "[{'name': '破壊の標', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。破壊の標はそれに５点のダメージを与える。破壊の標をオーナーのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '大焼炉の祝福は素晴らしい見ものだが、一番見栄えの良い場所は高くつく。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426672&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e04f345b-b765-4d54-9fcf-aaa971bccb76', 'multiverseId': 426672}, 'multiverseid': 426672}]", "[{'name': '空召喚士ターランド', 'text': 'あなたがインスタントかソーサリーである呪文を１つ唱えるたび、飛行を持つ青の２/２のドレイク・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — マーフォーク・ウィザード', 'flavor': '「海は広大だが、空はそれ以上に広大だ。その両方を統べることができるなら、なぜ１つの王国に満足しようか？」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426648&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37b99318-975f-4ce4-8d01-50a032882f35', 'multiverseId': 426648}, 'multiverseid': 426648}]", "[{'name': '精神の願望', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。その後あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。ターン終了時まで、あなたはそのカードをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。\\nストーム（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、このターンにこれより前に唱えられた呪文１つにつきこれを１回コピーする。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426641&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7e36fb4e-e432-41e2-b7b1-a11d39c5a8ec', 'multiverseId': 426641}, 'multiverseid': 426641}]", "[{'name': '罰する者、ゾーズー', 'text': '土地が１つ戦場に出るたび、罰する者、ゾーズーはその土地のコントローラーに２点のダメージを与える。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士', 'flavor': '侵入者には容赦ない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426678&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd6796585-b1d7-4b5c-9d8c-648c8fd5d5e8', 'multiverseId': 426678}, 'multiverseid': 426678}]", "[{'name': '耳障りな反応', 'text': '青のインスタント・呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '思考を粉砕する野蛮な叫び声。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426693&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e89fe462-8e26-4430-9238-5994c2ca3be2', 'multiverseId': 426693}, 'multiverseid': 426693}]", "[{'name': '若き紅蓮術士', 'text': 'あなたがインスタントかソーサリーである呪文を１つ唱えるたび、赤の１/１のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン', 'flavor': '焼身は最も誠実な追従である。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426657&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3977a1d6-2255-43bf-b129-f057738f84a5', 'multiverseId': 426657}, 'multiverseid': 426657}]", "[{'name': '血まみれ角のミノタウルス', 'text': '狂喜２（このターンに対戦相手にダメージが与えられていたなら、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１カウンターが２個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ミノタウルス・戦士', 'flavor': 'ミルティーンのミノタウルスの十一の氏族の中には、手工芸の達人もいれば、博学の哲学者もいる。残りは全部殴り担当だ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426675&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55911060-62c4-47f4-af60-3bd5c31f54f1', 'multiverseId': 426675}, 'multiverseid': 426675}]", "[{'name': '裂け目の稲妻', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。裂け目の稲妻はそれに３点のダメージを与える。\\n待機１―{R}（あなたの手札からこのカードを唱えるのではなく、あなたは{R}を支払うとともに時間カウンターを１個置いた状態でこれを追放してもよい。あなたのアップキープの開始時に、時間カウンターを１個取り除く。最後の１個を取り除いたとき、これをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱える。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426654&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7ea67def-4803-43cb-a95c-60dc8d3bb174', 'multiverseId': 426654}, 'multiverseid': 426654}]", "[{'name': '語られざるもの、忌話図', 'text': '飛行、トランプル\\n語られざるもの、忌話図がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたの墓地から秘儀・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — スピリット', 'flavor': '噂は恐ろしい。真実はさらに恐ろしい。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426650&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7956038f-3494-4b25-946e-bc01c4c73c8b', 'multiverseId': 426650}, 'multiverseid': 426650}]", "[{'name': '調和', 'text': 'カードを３枚引く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「言葉は嘘をつく。人々も嘘をつく。大地は真実を告げてくれる。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426683&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1ba663d-ad31-4d48-908e-6769d5dbfae8', 'multiverseId': 426683}, 'multiverseid': 426683}]", "[{'name': '賢者眼の報復者', 'text': '果敢（あなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を１つ唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\\n賢者眼の報復者が攻撃するたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それのパワーが賢者眼の報復者のパワーよりも小さいなら、あなたはそれをオーナーの手札に戻してもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ジン・モンク', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426645&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '19cc2fb8-c0cb-41b8-9521-ef6a79932ef7', 'multiverseId': 426645}, 'multiverseid': 426645}]", "[{'name': '遺跡潜り、ジョリー・エン', 'text': 'あなたが各ターンのあなたの２つ目の呪文を唱えるたび、カードを１枚引く。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — マーフォーク・ウィザード', 'flavor': '「遺物狩りの中にはエルドラージとの戦いに加わるため探検をやめてしまった者もいるわ。でも私たちの仕事は今こそ求められているの。発見がこの世界の救済につながるかもしれないのだから。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426660&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '62830055-7aa3-4188-8a04-9b0e5b863b22', 'multiverseId': 426660}, 'multiverseid': 426660}]", "[{'name': '雲冠の樫', 'text': '到達', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ツリーフォーク・戦士', 'flavor': '「頭のいいやつらは雲冠のそばに家を建てるのさ。鷹だの妖精だのが襲ってきたら、クローバーデルまで弾き飛ばされちまうからな。」\\n――キスキンの農夫、カリッド', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426682&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b91fedea-1898-41a5-b93e-3aacb35a87ad', 'multiverseId': 426682}, 'multiverseid': 426682}]", "[{'name': '霧中の到達', 'text': 'カードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'インスタント — 秘儀', 'flavor': '「名を一言知らば、妄想が始まりぬ。二言知らば、妄執が起こりぬ。三言知らば、狂気が降りぬ。すべて知らば、その先如何なるかを知るは神のみ。」\\n――あざみ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426644&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '605a0428-b75f-4ba5-a230-eadf579e546d', 'multiverseId': 426644}, 'multiverseid': 426644}]", "[{'name': '高まる残虐性', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを５個置く。高まる残虐性が墓地から唱えられたなら、代わりにそのクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを10個置く。\\nフラッシュバック{5}{G}{G}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426684&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a8360999-9338-4788-bf46-549d47c0643f', 'multiverseId': 426684}, 'multiverseid': 426684}]", "[{'name': '魔心のキマイラ', 'text': '飛行、トランプル\\n魔心のキマイラのパワーは、あなたの墓地にあるインスタントかソーサリーであるカードの総数に等しい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — キマイラ', 'flavor': '秘術師たちは、その言葉がより奇天烈な獣を呼び出すことを恐れ、キマイラの周辺では沈黙を守る。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=426662&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ba3b5a81-8227-43f4-95f8-63bb1f0bd2a6', 'multiverseId': 426662}, 'multiverseid': 426662}]"]
printings: ['10E', '2ED', '2X2', '2XM', '30A', '3ED', '40K', '4BB', '4ED', '5DN', '5ED', '6ED', '7ED', '8ED', '9ED', 'A25', 'AFC', 'AFR', 'AKH', 'AKR', 'ALA', 'ANA', 'ANB', 'ARC', 'ARN', 'ATH', 'AVR', 'BBD', 'BFZ', 'BLB', 'BRB', 'BRC', 'BRO', 'BTD', 'C13', 'C14', 'C15', 'C16', 'C17', 'C18', 'C19', 'C20', 'C21', 'CED', 'CEI', 'CHK', 'CLB', 'CLU', 'CM2', 'CMA', 'CMD', 'CMM', 'CMR', 'CNS', 'CSP', 'CST', 'DD1', 'DD2', 'DDD', 'DDE', 'DDF', 'DDG', 'DDH', 'DDI', 'DDJ', 'DDK', 'DDL', 'DDM', 'DDN', 'DDO', 'DDP', 'DDQ', 'DDR', 'DDS', 'DDT', 'DDU', 'DGM', 'DKA', 'DKM', 'DMR', 'DMU', 'DOM', 'DPA', 'DTK', 'E01', 'ELD', 'EMA', 'EVE', 'EVG', 'EXO', 'F07', 'F10', 'FBB', 'FRF', 'FUT', 'G08', 'G17', 'GK1', 'GK2', 'GN2', 'GN3', 'GNT', 'GPT', 'GRN', 'GS1', 'GTC', 'GVL', 'H09', 'HA1', 'HA3', 'HBG', 'HOP', 'HOU', 'ICE', 'IKO', 'IMA', 'INV', 'ISD', 'ITP', 'J14', 'J22', 'JMP', 'JVC', 'KHM', 'KLD', 'KLR', 'KTK', 'LCC', 'LCI', 'LEA', 'LEB', 'LRW', 'LTC', 'LTR', 'M10', 'M11', 'M12', 'M13', 'M14', 'M15', 'M19', 'M20', 'M21', 'MBS', 'ME1', 'ME3', 'MH1', 'MH2', 'MH3', 'MID', 'MIR', 'MKM', 'MM2', 'MM3', 'MMA', 'MMQ', 'MOM', 'MOR', 'MRD', 'NCC', 'NEC', 'NEO', 'NPH', 'ODY', 'OGW', 'OLEP', 'ONE', 'ONS', 'ORI', 'OTC', 'OTJ', 'P02', 'P08', 'P09', 'P15A', 'P23', 'PAL00', 'PAL01', 'PAL02', 'PAL03', 'PAL04', 'PAL05', 'PAL06', 'PAL99', 'PALP', 'PANA', 'PARL', 'PC2', 'PCA', 'PD2', 'PDTK', 'PELP', 'PF19', 'PF20', 'PFRF', 'PGPX', 'PGRU', 'PIP', 'PL24', 'PLC', 'PLST', 'PMPS', 'PMPS06', 'PMPS07', 'PMPS08', 'PMPS09', 'PMPS10', 'PMPS11', 'POGW', 'POR', 'PPP1', 'PRM', 'PRW2', 'PRWK', 'PS11', 'PSAL', 'PSS2', 'PSS3', 'PSS4', 'PTC', 'PTK', 'PW23', 'PZ1', 'PZ2', 'RAV', 'REX', 'RIX', 'RNA', 'ROE', 'RQS', 'RTR', 'RVR', 'S99', 'SCD', 'SCG', 'SHM', 'SIR', 'SLD', 'SNC', 'SOI', 'SOM', 'SS3', 'STA', 'STX', 'SUM', 'TD0', 'TD2', 'THB', 'THS', 'TMP', 'TPR', 'TSB', 'TSP', 'TSR', 'UGL', 'ULG', 'UMA', 'UND', 'UNF', 'UNH', 'USG', 'UST', 'V16', 'VMA', 'VOW', 'WAR', 'WC00', 'WC01', 'WC02', 'WC03', 'WC04', 'WC97', 'WC98', 'WC99', 'WHO', 'WOC', 'WOE', 'XANA', 'XLN', 'ZEN', 'ZNC', 'ZNR']
original_text: ["Add {R}{R}{R} to your mana pool.\\nSplice onto Arcane {1}{R} (As you cast an Arcane spell, you may reveal this card from your hand and pay its splice cost. If you do, add this card's effects to that spell.)", "Beacon of Destruction deals 5 damage to target creature or player. Shuffle Beacon of Destruction into its owner's library.", "Bloodthirst 1 (If an opponent was dealt damage this turn, this creature enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it.)\\nCreatures with power less than Skarrgan Pit-Skulk's power can't block it.", 'Bloodthirst 2 (If an opponent was dealt damage this turn, this creature enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.)', 'Counter target blue instant spell.', "Cowards can't block Warriors.\\n{R}: Target creature becomes a Coward until end of turn.\\n{2}{R}: Target creature becomes a Warrior until end of turn.", 'Create a 3/3 green Elephant creature token.\\nFlashback {3}{G} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Create a 4/4 green Beast creature token.\\nFlashback {2}{G}{G}{G} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Create a 6/6 green Wurm creature token.\\nFlashback {3}{G} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Create two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.\\nStorm (When you cast this spell, copy it for each spell cast before it this turn.)', "Deep-Sea Kraken can't be blocked.\\nSuspend 9—{2}{U} (Rather than cast this card from your hand, you may pay {2}{U} and exile it with nine time counters on it. At the beginning of your upkeep, remove a time counter. When the last is removed, cast it without paying its mana cost. It has haste.)\\nWhenever an opponent casts a spell, if Deep-Sea Kraken is suspended, remove a time counter from it.", "Defender\\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Nivix Cyclops gets +3/+0 until end of turn and can attack this turn as though it didn't have defender.", 'Draw a card.', 'Draw three cards.', "Draw two cards, then discard a card.\\nIf you've cast a spell named Peer Through Depths and a spell named Reach Through Mists this turn, you may search your library for a card named The Unspeakable, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle your library.", 'Each creature gets +1/+1 for each other creature on the battlefield that shares at least one creature type with it. (For example, if two Goblin Warriors and a Goblin Shaman are on the battlefield, each gets +2/+2.)', "Each creature that's a Barbarian, a Warrior, or a Berserker gets +2/+2 and has haste.", 'Firebolt deals 2 damage to target creature or player.\\nFlashback {4}{R} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', "Flying, trample\\nSpellheart Chimera's power is equal to the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard.", 'Flying, trample\\nWhenever The Unspeakable deals combat damage to a player, you may return target Arcane card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'G', 'Grapeshot deals 1 damage to target creature or player.\\nStorm (When you cast this spell, copy it for each spell cast before it this turn. You may choose new targets for the copies.)', 'Haste\\n{T}: Kamahl, Pit Fighter deals 3 damage to target creature or player.', 'Instant and sorcery spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.', 'Look at the top five cards of your library. You may reveal an instant or sorcery card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', "Prowess (Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nWhenever Sage-Eye Avengers attacks, you may return target creature to its owner's hand if its power is less than Sage-Eye Avengers's power.", 'Put five +1/+1 counters on target creature. If Increasing Savagery was cast from a graveyard, put ten +1/+1 counters on that creature instead.\\nFlashback {5}{G}{G} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'R', 'Reach', "Return target creature to its owner's hand. Untap up to two lands.", "Return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand. Volcanic Vision deals damage equal to that card's converted mana cost to each creature your opponents control. Exile Volcanic Vision.", "Return target permanent to its owner's hand.\\nStorm (When you cast this spell, copy it for each spell cast before it this turn. You may choose new targets for the copies.)", 'Rift Bolt deals 3 damage to target creature or player.\\nSuspend 1—{R} (Rather than cast this card from your hand, you may pay {R} and exile it with a time counter on it. At the beginning of your upkeep, remove a time counter. When the last is removed, cast it without paying its mana cost.)', 'Rugged Highlands enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Rugged Highlands enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {G} to your mana pool.', 'Search your library for a basic land card and put that card onto the battlefield tapped. Then shuffle your library.', 'Search your library for an instant card with converted mana cost 3, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then repeat this process for instant cards with converted mana costs 2 and 1. Then shuffle your library.', 'Shivan Meteor deals 13 damage to target creature.\\nSuspend 2—{1}{R}{R} (Rather than cast this card from your hand, you may pay {1}{R}{R} and exile it with two time counters on it. At the beginning of your upkeep, remove a time counter. When the last is removed, cast it without paying its mana cost.)', 'Shuffle your library. Then exile the top card of your library. Until end of turn, you may play that card without paying its mana cost.\\nStorm (When you cast this spell, copy it for each spell cast before it this turn.)', 'Swiftwater Cliffs enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Swiftwater Cliffs enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {R} to your mana pool.', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 and gains trample until end of turn.\\nFlashback {2}{G}{G} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', "Target player takes an extra turn after this one. Shuffle Beacon of Tomorrows into its owner's library.", 'The next sorcery card you cast this turn can be cast as though it had flash. (It can be cast any time you could cast an instant.)\\nDraw a card.', "Trample\\nCast Talara's Battalion only if you've cast another green spell this turn.", 'U', 'When Ambassador Oak enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 green Elf Warrior creature token.', 'When Burning-Tree Emissary enters the battlefield, add {R}{G} to your mana pool.', 'When Nucklavee enters the battlefield, you may return target red sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.\\nWhen Nucklavee enters the battlefield, you may return target blue instant card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Whenever Radha, Heir to Keld attacks, you may add {R}{R} to your mana pool.\\n{T}: Add {G} to your mana pool.', 'Whenever Rubblebelt Raiders attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on it for each attacking creature you control.', "Whenever a land enters the battlefield, Zo-Zu the Punisher deals 2 damage to that land's controller.", 'Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, Kruin Striker gets +1/+0 and gains trample until end of turn.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, create a 1/1 red Elemental creature token.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, create a 2/2 blue Drake creature token with flying.', 'Whenever you cast your second spell each turn, draw a card.', '{1}{R}{G}: Relentless Hunter gets +1/+1 and gains trample until end of turn.', "{2}, Exile a nonland card from your hand: Put four time counters on the exiled card. If it doesn't have suspend, it gains suspend. (At the beginning of your upkeep, remove a time counter from that card. When the last is removed, cast it without paying its mana cost. If it's a creature, it has haste.)"]
